      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Retrieved card, inspected pinned benchmark forward and benchmark primary method description. Original paper archive unavailable; fallback read. Recency partitioning already exists locally; unsuccessful aligned-fusion trajectories and tiny covariance gain motivate a targeted residual contrast, not adoption of another query/mixing backbone.",
